OL,3,AFrom Maya as Sir Mo Farah to Heidi as
OL,4,Aher own left hand: The best Halloween
OL,5,Alooks
OL,6,
OL,7,FSupermodel and TV host Heidi Klum
OL,8,Fconfirmed her position as the queen of
OL,9,FHalloween by transforming into a giant,
OL,10,Fbloodied and severed hand for her
OL,11,Fannual costume party in New York.
OL,13,FKlum, 53, was completely unrecognisable
OL,14,Farriving at her event in what she
OL,15,Fdescribed as her own chopped-off "left
OL,16,Fhand".
OL,18,FThis year marks the 25th anniversary of
OL,19,FKlum's party, which brings celebrities
OL,20,Facross the globe together dressed in
OL,21,Ftheir wild, weird and wonderful
OL,22,Fcostumes.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
